Package: project-anthony
Version: 1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Johnny Dalton Bohnenkamp
Depends: timeshift, gddrescue, bc, smartmontools, lm-sensors, gnome-terminal, kbd, libpam0g, python3
Description: Indestructible System Control Terminal & Life Raft
 Project Anthony provides a resilient Text User Interface (TUI).
 Ctrl+Alt+X opens the rescue TUI over a living desktop session.
 Ctrl+Alt+F3 is a kernel VT switch onto the TTY3 rescue console
 when the compositor is frozen. Alt+SysRq+R unraws a grabbed keyboard.
